static const u8 sTextLegendsCreator[] = _("{COLOR LIGHT_RED}{SHADOW DARK_GRAY}Welcome.\pBefore you take your first step…\nthere is something you should\nunderstand.\pThis world is larger than any one\nregion.\pIts people travel.\nIts POKéMON wander.\nIts legends endure.\pAnd sometimes…\nthings appear where they should\nnot.\pEvery journey begins somewhere.\nYours begins in Hoenn.\pBut where it ends…\nthat will be another matter\nentirely.\pI have only one request.\nExplore.\pQuestion what you see.\nAnd when something feels out of\nplace… remember it.\pNow then…\nsomeone is waiting for you.");
